FAS-WCA research release
========================

This distribution builds on GIT-BO:

  GIT-BO: High-Dimensional Bayesian Optimization with Tabular Foundation Models
  Copyright (c) 2026 Rosen Ting-Ying Yu, Cyril Picard, Faez Ahmed
  Licensed under the MIT License; the original license is retained in LICENSE.

The GIT-BO implementation includes a small number of compatibility and
numerical-consistency corrections. The algorithmic origin and these local
implementation changes must remain distinguishable in downstream use.

This distribution vendors the TabPFN fork shipped by the GIT-BO implementation
and expects the TabPFN-v2 regression checkpoint to be downloaded separately.
Built with PriorLabs-TabPFN. Consult the applicable TabPFN and model terms before
redistribution; no model checkpoint is included here.

The optional SRAM example integrates with OpenYield, an Apache-2.0 project, and
Xyce. OpenYield source, PDK/device models, simulator binaries, metadata and
licences are not redistributed in this repository.
